{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Despite destroying the primary Nazi stockpile of the deadly nerve agent Kleine Blume, one final cache survived! This stash has now been loaded into artillery shells ready for an imminent launch against multiple targets throughout France.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729150/extras/SER_OG-44_GIF_2.gif?t=1742305826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">With hundreds of thousands of civilian lives at stake, Harry Hawker launches a daring attempt to neutralise the remaining Wunderwaffe before they can be deployed. <br><br>To help you complete your mission, the M1941 Rifle and Armaguerra OG-44 will be added to your arsenal. Used by the U.S Marine Corps as an alternative to the M1 Garand, the M1941 is a powerful rifle with a 10-round high-capacity rotary magazine, requiring fewer reloads.<br><br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729150/extras/SER_Rifle_GIF_3.gif?t=1742305826\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whereas the Italian Armaguerra OG-44 is a submachine gun that has a recoil mechanism housed above the barrel, resulting in extremely low vertical recoil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Vercors Vendetta Mission and Weapons Pack contains: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tThe Vercors Vendetta Campaign Mission</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tM1941 Rifle</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022\tArmaguerra OG-44 Submachine Gun</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2729150?t=1742305826","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729150/19c9320b0de539f07f9166bdfb25c976f445e280/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1742305826","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2729150/c3b31fdc490c369bbc9ac6b7c66